# Huginn's own pieces that replaced KDE's:
#  - Open and Save windows (apps/huginn_portal.py) through the desktop portal
#  - Huginn's own compositor (compositor/, built on Smithay; the "own compositor" session at the sign-in screen):
#    what it needs at run time (the build installs Rust and the headers only while building it, then takes them out)
#  - the earlier preview compositor in Python (shell/huginn_compositor.py + qml/Compositor.qml), still there for
#    `huginn_shell.py --compositor` until the Rust one takes over everywhere
xdg-desktop-portal
libseat1
libinput10
libdisplay-info3
libgbm1
libxkbcommon0
libpixman-1-0
qml6-module-qtwayland-compositor
qml6-module-qtquick-effects
qml6-module-qtcore
xwayland
libxcb-cursor0
